<title>LEBANON: Lebanon February trade deficit at $508 mln.</title>
<headline>Lebanon February trade deficit at $508 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BEIRUT 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lebanon's trade deficit rose to $508 million in February from $426 million in January, according to monthly customs figures released on Monday.</p>
<p>    MERCHANDISE TRADE	Feb 97     Jan 97	Feb 96</p>
<p>Monthly</p>
<p>    Exports		     63.0	 89.6	   69.0</p>
<p>    Imports		    571.0	515.0	  517.0</p>
<p>    Trade balance	   -508.0     -426.0	 -448.0</p>
<p>Year-to-date</p>
<p>    Exports		    152.0	 89.6	  147.0</p>
<p>    Imports		  1,086.0	515.0	1,088.0</p>
<p>    Trade balance	   -934.0     -426.0	 -941.0</p>
<p>Note - Figures in millions of U.S. dollars.</p>
<p>-Beirut editorial (961 1) 602057 745307 745308</p>
